      "cooked": "<p>i found choosed minor power card by aid from lesser spirits is immediately put into play(not play),&nbsp;and can target by repeat effect.</p>\n<p>then, at the end of turn, that card is discard to their personal discard pile? or, that card is still stay in play?</p>\n<p>and, when spirit gain a major power card, can forget that card?</p>",
