      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-08-04T16:00:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You have three questions there:</p>\n<p>(a) I believe you're correct, that the card from Aid from Lesser Spirits can be targeted by Repeat effects. I'm not 100% positive.</p>\n<p>(b) The card remains in play next turn and all future turns.</p>\n<p>(c) No, the card is not one of the Spirit's powers; you can't forget it.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:09:10.975Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
